  // What is built of Kanto so far (plan 19). The maps are FireRed's, read by tools/MapImporter's GBA reader
  // (plan 18 · W6, W7: --game firered); "maps" are the maps the game makes from its matrices, "areas" the areas
  // open to walk in. After adding an area, run `dotnet run --project tools/MapImporter -- --game firered --data`
  // and write its overlay (overlays/<key>.json). A room is a matrix of its own built from its layout ("Indoors").
  "region": "Kanto",
  // A GBA game's houses are drawn into its tiles: each is found at its door (WorldMapBuilder.BuildingsAtDoors)
  "buildingsAtDoors": true,
  "maps": [
